{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141560/extras/3f26c34c69cab547d3b88607705b8c2b.avif?t=1751276142\" width=776 height=336 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Star Rising</strong> <strong>is a\u00a0dungeon crawling, spatial-deck building, node traversing, mashup.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a nameless figure, adorned with an irremovable mask and an inescapable fate.  The world around you has fallen to Ruin countless times over.  You\u2019ve stood aside powerless to stop it;  ready to be swallowed by dusk and the darkness it brings.  This time is different - this time the light will shine.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This game aims to deliver a dungeon crawler  with an emphasis on deck building.   We offer the following to the player:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Unique 2D deck building.\u00a0 Collected cards are placed in a 2D grid by the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Node-graph traversal and combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Interesting setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Unique art style</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141560?t=1751276142","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141560?t=1751276142","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141560/c63f943c015bad2a620f7063a3f820fac3f9bb7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751276142","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141560/c63f943c015bad2a620f7063a3f820fac3f9bb7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751276142","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragr